config SERIAL_EARLYCON_RTT
	bool "Early console using SEGGER RTT (Deluge / RZ/A1L bring-up)"
	depends on ARM
	select SERIAL_CORE
	select SERIAL_CORE_CONSOLE
	select SERIAL_EARLYCON
	help
	  Early console that writes into a SEGGER RTT control block in on-chip
	  SRAM, read by a J-Link debug probe via background memory access (no
	  UART needed).  U-Boot sets up and hands off the control block.
	  Enable with "earlycon=rtt,0x20080000" on the kernel command line.
